# STRATAVEX - environment configuration (placeholders only; never commit real secrets)
#
# The application runs fully in "Local Document Search / Demo" mode with NO
# credentials. Document processing, retrieval, validation, reporting, duplicate
# detection and conflict review all work without any of the values below.
#
# To upgrade the AI Query Workspace from extractive local search to real
# retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) with a generative model, provide an
# OpenAI-compatible chat completions endpoint. The retrieved evidence is sent
# as grounded context; answers are then associated with those same citations.
#
# VITE_AI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
# VITE_AI_API_KEY=sk-REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_KEY
# VITE_AI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
#
# NOTE: Because this is a browser application, any key placed here is exposed to
# the client. Only use a restricted/keyed proxy for anything non-demo. This
# project defaults to a fully local mode precisely to avoid shipping secrets.
